.TH geectl-remote-delete-link 1  "geectl-remote-delete-link 0.2.2" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-remote\-delete\-link \- Delete a `_link` file from a package. A mutation: dry\-run is the default (only the plan is printed); `\-\-live` performs the deletion. The package keeps its files and meta, but stops tracking the source
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl remote delete\-link\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPROJECT\fR> <\fIPACKAGE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Delete a `_link` file from a package. A mutation: dry\-run is the default (only the plan is printed); `\-\-live` performs the deletion. The package keeps its files and meta, but stops tracking the source
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPROJECT\fR>
The project the package lives in
.TP
<\fIPACKAGE\fR>
The package whose `_link` is deleted
.SH VERSION
v0.2.2
